# M28 Weld Edges (UE UWeldMeshEdgesTool, MeshOps palette "Mesh"): Box 100 cm with its top face disconnected in PolyModel (UE PolyEdit Disconnect) -> the open edges shown by Hole Fill -> Weld Edges (preview, the open edges left drawn red) -> Accept -> Undo. Wireframe, seen from above and to the side.
Дано run View "View mode: Wireframe"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.3,-0.9,0.3
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,0,0
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Дано run Modeling "Select Elements tool"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection mode: PolyGroup"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh operation: Disconnect"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh tool: Hole Fill"
Тогда 0_open the top face's perimeter is drawn as open edges (red rims: the lid's and the walls'); the Mesh palette shows Hole Fill "Holes: 0 selected of 2"; the log reports the Disconnect with open edges > 0
Когда run Modeling "Mesh tool: Weld Edges"
Тогда 1_weld no open edge is drawn; the Mesh palette shows Weld Edges with "8 open edges, 4 edge pairs welded ..., 0 open edges remain"
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда-вид 1_weld_accepted after Accept the Box is whole in wireframe (the tool ended); the log has "Weld Edges accepted: 8 open edges, 4 edge pairs welded, 0 open edges remain"
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Modeling "Mesh tool: Hole Fill"
Тогда 2_undo after Undo the top perimeter's open edges are drawn again (Hole Fill "Holes: 0 selected of 2")
